{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28284","headline":"长安杂题长句六首 四 · 杜牧","name":"长安杂题长句六首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"束带谬趋文石陛，有章曾拜皁囊封。\n期严无奈睡留癖，势窘犹爲酒泥慵。\n偷钓侯家池上雨，醉吟隋寺日沈钟。\n九原可作吾谁与，师友琅琊邴曼容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}